{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865130/extras/914f69e0df49b0f19a69188c418f6ba2.avif?t=1768657606\" width=212 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The loved ones we lost long ago returned to us on the island, in different bodies. Who can we trust now?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 1716. The 6th Voyager Fleet, leaving port, is crashed by a violent storm. A group of survivors washes ashore on a misty island, insisting their long dead loved ones have returned, reincarnated in unfamiliar faces. There are no such records from previous expeditionary fleets, and indeed, no surviving explorers... Under the island's mists, neither real nor truth becomes unclear. Don't forget who you are... Can you trust those beside you? </strong><br><strong>Sahir: Shiv of Memories is a classic story-driven JRPG blended with survival mechanics. Gather your party, choose who you trust amidst the mysterious events unfolding on the island, and fight to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865130/extras/05cf86de273cb7945b22d533e78cd697.avif?t=1768657606\" width=94 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Shape your story through your choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 5 playable classes, with their own unique mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 7 party members, with their distinct backstory</strong><br><strong>\u2022 Modernized turn-based combat with 200+ unique skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 A vast island to explore, rich with mysterious stories</strong><br><strong>\u2022 A unique atmosphere infused with Turkish, Slavic, Celtic, and Buddhist mythologies</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865130?t=1768657606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865130?t=1768657606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865130/60d7a1284e305d46017ff5a7a3461dc6a40c9a90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768657606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865130/60d7a1284e305d46017ff5a7a3461dc6a40c9a90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768657606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Sahir: Shiv of Memories includes fantasy violence, use of alcohol, and mild partial nudity.\r\n\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865130/extras/914f69e0df49b0f19a69188c418f6ba2.avif?t=1768657606\" width=212 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The loved ones we lost long ago returned to us on the island, in different bodies. Who can we trust now?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Year 1716. The 6th Voyager Fleet, leaving port, is crashed by a violent storm. A group of survivors washes ashore on a misty island, insisting their long dead loved ones have returned, reincarnated in unfamiliar faces. There are no such records from previous expeditionary fleets, and indeed, no surviving explorers... Under the island's mists, neither real nor truth becomes unclear. Don't forget who you are... Can you trust those beside you? </strong><br><strong>Sahir: Shiv of Memories is a classic story-driven JRPG blended with survival mechanics. Gather your party, choose who you trust amidst th